        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bella Villa Floral Knob with Contoured Radius Rose Fusion 35-A7 </b>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you demand quality and craftmanship make a statement with Fusion. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features of Floral Knob:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backed by a lifetme limited warranty</li>\r\n<li>High Quality Custom Solid Brass Knob. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When choosing a function:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Note: Dummy knobs and levers are bolt-through. Screws actually attach the dummies from the interior side of the door, which makes for a clean exterior visual. This applies to single and double dummys.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
